      "text": "求 $y=\\tanh x=\\dfrac{e^x-e^{-x}}{e^x+e^{-x}}$ 的导数，用 $y$ 表示，并给出该导数的值域。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "双曲函数求导",
        "值域分析"
      ],
      "question_type": "导数计算与值域分析",
      "method": [
        "利用tanh的导数恒等式"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "求导得到1-y^2的表达式",
        "分析tanh值域得出导数值域"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "derivative_in_terms_of_function_value",
        "template": "y=\\tanh x,\\ y'=1-y^2",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 6,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "利用恒等式 $\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\tanh x=\\mathrm{sech}^2x=1-\\tanh^2x$，故 $y'=1-y^2$。",
            "因为 $x\\in\\mathbb{R}$ 时 $y=\\tanh x\\in(-1,1)$，故 $y^2\\in[0,1)$，因此 $y'=1-y^2\\in(0,1]$。",
            "验证：$x=0$ 时 $y=0$，$y'=1$，恰为最大值，与直接求导 $y'(0)=\\mathrm{sech}^2(0)=1$ 一致。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kyoto-2021-80fb76336b-q02-practice-02",
